GRAB reference package v1.0.0

This provider-neutral, data-only package exercises the Connector SDK. Its
source link identifies the HTTP protocol; the fixture API is documented here.
No Stripe, Lulu, or other commercial provider support is claimed.

The local fake-provider harness implements GET /messages/{id} and POST /messages.
POST requires a stable Idempotency-Key and Bearer credential; repeat keys return
the original result and conflicting bodies return 409. Different credentials
have separate key spaces. The notification webhook uses grab-hmac-sha256-v1.
Run Go SDK tests; no package scripts or downloads execute at application startup.
